    "name": "MaintainX Asset Criticalities API",
    "description": "REST API V1\n\nSupport: support@getmaintainx.com | https://www.getmaintainx.com/\n\nThis is the MaintainX REST API reference. It provides detailed documentation for endpoints, request parameters, response schemas, and error codes available.\n\nFor setup guides, authentication walkthroughs, how-tos, etc., see the Build With MaintainX guide.\n\nWhat's in this reference:\n\nFull endpoint listings across all MaintainX entities (Work Orders, Assets, Parts, Locations, Users, and more)\n\nRequest and response schemas with field-level detail\n\nQuery parameters, filters, and pagination behavior\n\nAuthentication requirements and error codes\n\nSubscriptions and webhooks for event-driven integrations\n\nBase URL: https://api.getmaintainx.com/v1\n\nAll requests must be authenticated with a Bearer token (see Settings > Integrations > API Keys to generate a key).\n\nAPI access is available on Premium and Enterprise plans.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Support\n Email: support@getmaintainx.com",
